#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:100
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs the check again with --accept, so the state file holds what was just handled and the next poll compares against it. A row the pass could not finish stays changed and is picked up on the next poll."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:64
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs Tool review-log-watch with the folio repository, the saved values and the log's state file. The tool reads the repository's open and closed issues (no pull requests, no issue labelled no-sheet) and compares a digest of them and of the cells people set (Title, Selected Sections, Contributor Feedback, Disposition, Ready for agent, Ready for merge, Dispositions confirmed; on a public-comment log also Committee Feedback, TWG (CS), TWG (human), Change Set (human)) with the last check's. A read with no Issue column tracks only change-set issues and appends no rows, reporting them as issue-unlinked. It writes nothing."
msgstr ""

